              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasongo awo ayephakeme kangangokuthi ayesabekayo; amasongo awo ayegcwele amehlo nxazonke kuzo zozine.",
          "type": "text",
