              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okufana komkhathi phezu kwamakhanda ezidalwa eziphilayo kwakunjengombala wekristalu elesabekayo, wendlalwe phezu kwamakhanda azo.",
