              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngase ngibona okunjengokubonakala komlilo phakathi kwawo nxazonke, kusukela okhalweni lwakhe kuya phezulu, kusukela okhalweni lwakhe kuya phansi, ngabona okungathi kufana nomlilo; ukukhanya nxazonke.",
          "type": "text",
